{"id":"3befcba3ff8da9d2","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-divisor.md","title":"Divisor","display":"df-divisor — Divisor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-divisor","aliases":["58-df-divisor","Divisor"],"display":"df-divisor — Divisor","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-ring-of-integers.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-valuation.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-divisor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-divisor</span><span>Divisor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-divisor — Divisor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e62b6beb4c1e82d\" href=\"?note=4e62b6beb4c1e82d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ring-of-integers.md\">../batch10/58-df-ring-of-integers.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fb569bc36cce327\" href=\"?note=0fb569bc36cce327\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-valuation.md\">../batch13/58-df-valuation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> (number field)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{O}_K\">\\(\\mathcal{O}_K\\)</span> (ring of integers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak P_K=\\{\\mathfrak p\\subsetneq\\mathcal O_K:\\operatorname{PrimeIdeal}(\\mathfrak p,\\mathcal O_K)\\land\\mathfrak p\\neq\\{0\\}\\}\">\\(\\mathfrak P_K=\\{\\mathfrak p\\subsetneq\\mathcal O_K:\\operatorname{PrimeIdeal}(\\mathfrak p,\\mathcal O_K)\\land\\mathfrak p\\neq\\{0\\}\\}\\)</span> (set of nonzero prime ideals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,D&#39;\">\\(D,D&#39;\\)</span> (formal-sum candidates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in K^\\times\">\\(f\\in K^\\times\\)</span> (principal-divisor parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> (degree candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}_S\\)</span> (finiteness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_{\\mathfrak p}:K^\\times\\to\\mathbb Z\">\\(v_{\\mathfrak p}:K^\\times\\to\\mathbb Z\\)</span> (normalized additive valuation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N(\\mathfrak p)=|\\mathcal O_K/\\mathfrak p|\">\\(N(\\mathfrak p)=|\\mathcal O_K/\\mathfrak p|\\)</span> (absolute ideal norm)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Divisor}_K\">\\(\\operatorname{Divisor}_K\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Effective}_K\">\\(\\operatorname{Effective}_K\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PrincipalDivisor}_K\">\\(\\operatorname{PrincipalDivisor}_K\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LinearlyEquivalent}_K\">\\(\\operatorname{LinearlyEquivalent}_K\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Degree}_K\">\\(\\operatorname{Degree}_K\\)</span> (relations defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divisor} \\vdash \\operatorname{Divisor}_K(D) \\leftrightarrow \\exists n\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathfrak P_K}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}_S(\\{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathfrak P_K:n(\\mathfrak p)\\neq0\\})\\land D=\\sum_{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathfrak P_K}n(\\mathfrak p)\\mathfrak p\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divisor} \\vdash \\operatorname{Divisor}_K(D) \\leftrightarrow \\exists n\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathfrak P_K}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}_S(\\{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathfrak P_K:n(\\mathfrak p)\\neq0\\})\\land D=\\sum_{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathfrak P_K}n(\\mathfrak p)\\mathfrak p\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divisor\\text{-}effective} \\vdash \\operatorname{Effective}_K(D) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Divisor}_K(D)\\land\\exists n\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathfrak P_K}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}_S(\\{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathfrak P_K:n(\\mathfrak p)\\neq0\\})\\land D=\\sum_{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathfrak P_K}n(\\mathfrak p)\\mathfrak p\\land\\forall\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathfrak P_K\\;(n(\\mathfrak p)\\geq0)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divisor\\text{-}effective} \\vdash \\operatorname{Effective}_K(D) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Divisor}_K(D)\\land\\exists n\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathfrak P_K}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}_S(\\{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathfrak P_K:n(\\mathfrak p)\\neq0\\})\\land D=\\sum_{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathfrak P_K}n(\\mathfrak p)\\mathfrak p\\land\\forall\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathfrak P_K\\;(n(\\mathfrak p)\\geq0)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divisor\\text{-}principal} \\vdash \\operatorname{PrincipalDivisor}_K(f,D) \\leftrightarrow f\\in K^\\times\\land\\operatorname{Divisor}_K(D)\\land D=\\sum_{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathfrak P_K}v_{\\mathfrak p}(f)\\mathfrak p\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divisor\\text{-}principal} \\vdash \\operatorname{PrincipalDivisor}_K(f,D) \\leftrightarrow f\\in K^\\times\\land\\operatorname{Divisor}_K(D)\\land D=\\sum_{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathfrak P_K}v_{\\mathfrak p}(f)\\mathfrak p\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divisor\\text{-}linear\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\operatorname{LinearlyEquivalent}_K(D,D&#39;) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Divisor}_K(D)\\land\\operatorname{Divisor}_K(D&#39;)\\land\\exists f\\in K^\\times\\;\\operatorname{PrincipalDivisor}_K(f,D-D&#39;)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divisor\\text{-}linear\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\operatorname{LinearlyEquivalent}_K(D,D&#39;) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Divisor}_K(D)\\land\\operatorname{Divisor}_K(D&#39;)\\land\\exists f\\in K^\\times\\;\\operatorname{PrincipalDivisor}_K(f,D-D&#39;)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divisor\\text{-}degree} \\vdash \\operatorname{Degree}_K(D,r) \\leftrightarrow r\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\operatorname{Divisor}_K(D)\\land\\exists n\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathfrak P_K}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}_S(\\{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathfrak P_K:n(\\mathfrak p)\\neq0\\})\\land D=\\sum_{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathfrak P_K}n(\\mathfrak p)\\mathfrak p\\land r=\\sum_{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathfrak P_K}n(\\mathfrak p)\\log N(\\mathfrak p)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divisor\\text{-}degree} \\vdash \\operatorname{Degree}_K(D,r) \\leftrightarrow r\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\operatorname{Divisor}_K(D)\\land\\exists n\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathfrak P_K}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}_S(\\{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathfrak P_K:n(\\mathfrak p)\\neq0\\})\\land D=\\sum_{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathfrak P_K}n(\\mathfrak p)\\mathfrak p\\land r=\\sum_{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathfrak P_K}n(\\mathfrak p)\\log N(\\mathfrak p)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom uses the finite-prime divisor group of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathcal O_K\">\\(\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathcal O_K\\)</span>; Arakelov divisors additionally include archimedean places.</li>\n<li>On the regular one-dimensional scheme <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathcal O_K\">\\(\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathcal O_K\\)</span>, Weil and Cartier divisors agree.</li>\n<li>The logarithmic degree shown here is not zero on finite-part principal divisors unless the archimedean contributions are also included.</li>\n<li>Class group: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cl}(K) = \\operatorname{Div}(K) / \\operatorname{Princ}(K)\">\\(\\operatorname{Cl}(K) = \\operatorname{Div}(K) / \\operatorname{Princ}(K)\\)</span>; measures UFD failure</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Neukirch, Algebraic Number Theory</li>\n<li>Marcus, Number Fields</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-ring-of-integers.md","status":"resolved","id":"4e62b6beb4c1e82d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-ring-of-integers.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-valuation.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fb569bc36cce327","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-valuation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a35